*[[Coleford, Gloucestershire|Coleford]]
*[[English Bicknor, Gloucestershire|English Bicknor]]
*[[Huntley, Gloucestershire|Huntley]]
*[[Lydney, Gloucestershire|Lydney]]
*[[Milkwall, Gloucestershire|Milkwall]]
*[[Mitcheldean]]
*[[Newlands, Gloucestershire|Newlands]]
*[[Parkend, Gloucestershire|Parkend]]
*[[St Briavels, Gloucestershire|St Briavels]]
*[[Yorkley, Gloucestershire|Yorkley]]

==Places of interest==
