      <comment>[[WP:AWB|Assisted]] stub re-categorization for [[charitable organization]]s</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">The '''American Himalayan Foundation''' is a US [[non-profit]] that helps improve the ecology and living conditions in the [[Himalayas]] (populated by [[Nepalese]], [[Sherpa (people)|Sherpa]]s, and [[Tibetans]]). 

It was founded by [[Richard C. Blum]]. [[Edmund Hillary]] is Honorary President of the Foundation.

