      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Infobox_river | river_name = Brigach
  | image_name = 
  | caption = 
  | origin = [[Black Forest]] 
  | mouth = [[Danube]]
  | basin_countries = [[Germany]]
  | length = 43 km
  | elevation = 925 m
  | discharge = 
  | watershed = 195 km²
