The '''Brigach''' is the shorter of the two [[Germany|German]] rivers that form the [[Danube]] river. It has its source at 925 m above sea level in St. Georgen in the [[Black Forest]]. After 43 km, it joins the [[Breg]] river in [[Donaueschingen]] to form the Danube.

