    <title>List of Minister-Presidents of Bavaria</title>
    <id>229685</id>
    <revision>
      <id>32794170</id>
      <timestamp>2005-12-26T20:30:50Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Gogafax</username>
        <id>657768</id>
      </contributor>
      <comment>/* Bavaria under the monarchy */</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">This is a list of the men who have served in the capacity of [[Minister President]] or equivalent office in [[Bavaria]] from the mid-18th century to the present:

==Bavaria under the monarchy==
*Count Franz Joseph von Berchem 1745-1777
*Count Matthäus von Vieregg 1777-1799
*[[Maximilian von Montgelas|Count Maximilian von Montgelas]] 1799-1817
*Count Heinrich Aloys von Reigersberg 1817-1825
*Baron Georg Friedrich von Zentner 1825-1832
*Friedrich August Koch 1832-1837
*Karl von Abel 1837-1847
*Baron Friedrich August von Zu Rhein 1847
*Prince Ludwig of Öttingen-Wallerstein 1847-1848
*Count Klemens von Waldkirch 1848
*Count Otto von Bray-Steinburg 1848-1849
*Baron Karl Ludwig von der Pfordten 1849-1859
*Baron Karl von Schrenck 1859-1864
*Max Ritter von Neumayr 1864
*Baron Karl Ludwig von der Pfordten 1864-1866
*[[Prince Chlodwig zu Hohenlohe-Schillingsfürst]] 1866-1870
*Count Otto von Bray-Steinburg 1870-1871
*Baron Friedrich von Hegnenberg-Dux 1871-1872
*[[Adolph von Pfretzschner]] 1872-1880
*Baron Johann von Lutz 1880-1890
*Baron Krafft von Crailsheim 1890-1903
*Count [[Clemens von Podewils-Dürnitz]] 1903-1912
*[[Georg von Hertling|Count Georg von Hertling]] 1912-1917
*Otto Ritter von Dandl 1917-1918

== Bavaria in the [[Weimar Republic]] ==

*[[Kurt Eisner]] ([[Independent Social Democratic Party of Germany|USPD]]) 1918-1919
*[[Johannes Hoffmann]] ([[Social Democratic Party of Germany|SPD]]) 1919-1920
*[[Gustav Ritter von Kahr|Gustav von Kahr]] (non-partisan) 1920-1921
*[[Hugo Graf von und zu Lerchenfeld]] ([[Bavarian People's Party|BVP]]) 1921-1922
*[[Eugen Ritter von Knilling]] ([[Bavarian People's Party|BVP]]) 1922-1924
*[[Heinrich Held]] ([[Bavarian People's Party|BVP]]) 1924-1933

== Bavaria in [[Nazi Germany]] ==

*Franz Ritter von Epp ([[Nazi Party|NSDAP]]) 1933
*Ludwig Siebert ([[Nazi Party|NSDAP]]) 1933-1942
*Paul Giesler ([[Nazi Party|NSDAP]]) 1942-1945

== Modern Bavaria ==

*[[Fritz Schäffer]] ([[Bavarian People's Party|BVP]]) 1945
*[[Wilhelm Hoegner]] ([[Social Democratic Party of Germany|SPD]]) 1945-1946
*[[Hans Ehard]] ([[Christian Social Union|CSU]]) 1946-1954
*[[Wilhelm Hoegner]] ([[Social Democratic Party of Germany|SPD]]) 1954-1957
*[[Hanns Seidel]] ([[Christian Social Union|CSU]]) 1957-1960
*[[Hans Ehard]] ([[Christian Social Union|CSU]]) 1960-1962
*[[Alfons Goppel]] ([[Christian Social Union|CSU]]) 1962-1978
*[[Franz Josef Strauß]] ([[Christian Social Union|CSU]]) 1978-1988
*[[Max Streibl]] ([[Christian Social Union|CSU]]) 1988-1993
*[[Edmund Stoiber]] ([[Christian Social Union|CSU]]) 1993-present


[[de:Bayerischer Ministerpräsident]]
[[nl:Lijst van ministers-presidenten van Beieren]]
[[Category:Minister-Presidents of Bavaria| ]]</text>
