* [[Berlin (carriage)|Berlin]]
* [[Brake (carriage)|Brake]]
* [[Britzka]]
* [[Brougham]]
* [[Buggy]]
* [[Cab]]
* [[Cabriolet]]
* [[Calash]]
* [[Cape cart]]
* [[Cariole]]
* [[Carryall]]
* [[Chaise]]
* [[Clarence (carriage)|Clarence]]
* [[Coach]]
|valign|
* [[Coupé]]
* [[Curricle]]
* [[Dog cart]]
* [[Dos-à-dos]]
* [[Drag (disambiguation)|Drag]]
* [[Dray]]
* [[Droshky]] ([[Drozhki]])
* [[Equipage]]
* [[Fiacre]]
* [[Fly (disambiguation)|Fly]]
* [[Four-in-hand]]
* [[Gharry]]
* [[Gig (carriage)|Gig]]
* [[Gladstone carriage|Gladstone]]
* [[Hackney carriage|Hackney]]
|valign|
* [[Hansom]]
* [[Herdic]]
* [[Jaunting car]]
* [[Landau (car)|Landau]]
* [[Limousine (carriage)|Limousine]]
* [[Meadowbrook]]
* [[One-horse carriage]]
* [[Phaeton]]
* [[Post chaise]]
* [[Randem]]
* [[Ratha]]
* [[Rig]]
* [[Rockaway (carriage)|Rockaway]]
* [[Spider phaeton]]
* [[Stagecoach]]
|valign|
* [[Sulky]]
* [[Surrey (disambiguation)|Surrey]]
* [[Tarantass]] ([[Tarantas]])
* [[Telega]]
* [[Tilbury (carriage)|Tilbury]]
