* '''Loaded:''' 6345 kg
* '''Maximum takeoff:''' 6537 kg
* '''Powerplant:''' 1x AM-42, 1770 hp (1.3 MW)

===Performance===
* '''Maximum speed:''' 545 km/h at 2700 m; 500 km/h at ground level
* '''Range:''' 800 km
* '''Service ceiling:''' 4,000 m
* '''Rate of climb:'''   m/s
* '''Wing loading:''' 211 kg/m²
* '''Power/mass:''' W/kg,

