      <text xml:space="preserve">The 1st [[Golden Raspberry Awards]] were held on [[March 31]], [[1981]]. They were presented at [[John Wilson]]'s living room alcove and recognized the worst the film industry had to offer of [[1980 in film|1980]]. The event was scheduled the day before, but [[John Hinckley]]'s attempt on [[Ronald Reagan]]'s life delayed the Oscars, and thus the Razzies, by a day. The recipients are denoted in '''bold''':

==Worst Picture==

'''''[[Can't Stop the Music]]'' ([[Associated Film Distribution|AFD]]), produced by [[Allan Carr]]'''
:''[[Cruising (movie)|Cruising]]'' ([[Lorimar Productions|Lorimar]]/[[United Artists]]), produced by [[Jerry Weintraub]]
:''[[The Formula]]'' ([[Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer|MGM]]/[[United Artists]]), produced by [[Steve Shagan]]
:''[[Friday the 13th (film)|Friday the 13th]]'' ([[Paramount Pictures|Paramount]]), produced by [[Sean S. Cunningham]]
:''[[The Jazz Singer (1980 film)|The Jazz Singer]]'' ([[Associated Film Distribution|AFD]]), produced by [[Jerry Leider]]
:''[[The Nude Bomb]]'' ([[Universal Studios|Universal]]), produced by [[Jennings Lang]]
:''[[Raise the Titanic!]]'' ([[Associated Film Distribution|AFD]]), produced by [[William Frye]]
:''[[Saturn 3]]'' ([[Associated Film Distribution|AFD]]), produced by [[Stanley Donen]]
:''[[Windows (film)|Windows]]'' ([[United Artists]]), produced by [[Michael Lobell]]
:''[[Xanadu (film)|Xanadu]]'' ([[Universal Studios|Universal]]), produced by [[Lawrence Gordon]]

==Worst Actor==

'''[[Neil Diamond]] in ''[[The Jazz Singer (1980 film)|The Jazz Singer]]'''''
:[[Michael Beck]] in ''[[Xanadu (film)|Xanadu]]''
:[[Robert Blake (actor)|Robert Blake]] in ''[[Coast to Coast (film)|Coast to Coast]]''
:[[Michael Caine]] in ''[[Dressed to Kill]]'' and ''[[The Island (1980 film)|The Island]]''
:[[Kirk Douglas]] in ''[[Saturn 3]]''
:[[Richard Dreyfuss]] in ''[[The Competition]]''
:[[Anthony Hopkins]] in ''[[A Change of Seasons (film)|A Change of Seasons]]''
:[[Bruce Jenner]] in ''[[Can't Stop the Music]]''
:[[Sam J. Jones]] in ''[[Flash Gordon]]''

==Worst Actress==

'''[[Brooke Shields]] in''' '''''[[The Blue Lagoon (1980 film)|The Blue Lagoon]]'''''
:[[Nancy Allen (actress)|Nancy Allen]] in ''[[Dressed to Kill]]''
:[[Faye Dunaway]] in ''[[First Deadly Sin]]''
:[[Shelley Duvall]] in ''[[The Shining (film)|The Shining]]''
:[[Farrah Fawcett]] in ''[[Saturn 3]]''
:[[Sondra Locke]] in ''[[Bronco Billy]]''
:[[Olivia Newton-John]] in ''[[Xanadu (film)|Xanadu]]''
:[[Valerie Perrine]] in ''[[Can't Stop the Music]]''
:[[Deborah Raffin]] in ''[[Touched by Love]]''
:[[Talia Shire]] in ''[[Windows (film)|Windows]]''

==Worst Supporting Actor==

'''[[John Adames]] in ''[[Gloria (film)|Gloria]]''''' (tie)&lt;br&gt;
'''[[Laurence Olivier]] in ''[[The Jazz Singer (1980 film)|The Jazz Singer]]''''' (tie)
:[[Marlon Brando]] in ''[[The Formula]]''
:[[Charles Grodin]] in ''[[Seems Like Old Times]]''
:[[David Selby]] in ''[[Raise the Titanic]]''

==Worst Supporting Actress==

'''[[Amy Irving]] in ''[[Honeysuckle Rose]]'''''
:[[Elizabeth Ashley]] in ''[[Windows (film)|Windows]]''
:[[Georg Sanford Brown]] in ''[[Stir Crazy (movie)|Stir Crazy]]''
:[[Betsy Palmer]] in ''[[Friday the 13th (movie)|Friday the 13th]]''
:[[Marilyn Sokol]] in ''[[Can't Stop the Music]]''

==Worst Director==

'''[[Robert Greenwald]] for ''[[Xanadu (film)|Xanadu]]'''''
:[[John G. Avildsen]] for ''[[The Formula]]''
:[[Brian dePalma]] for ''[[Dressed to Kill]]''
:[[William Friedkin]] for ''[[Cruising (movie)|Cruising]]''
:[[Sidney J. Furie]] and [[Richard Fleischer]] for ''[[The Jazz Singer (1980 film)|The Jazz Singer]]''
:[[Stanley Kubrick]] for ''[[The Shining (film)|The Shining]]''
:[[Michael Ritchie]] for ''[[The Island (1980 film)|The Island]]''
:[[John Trent]] for ''[[Middle Age Crazy]]''
:[[Nancy Walker]] for ''[[Can't Stop the Music]]''
:[[Gordon Willis]] for ''[[Windows (film)|Windows]]''

==Worst Screenplay==

'''''[[Can't Stop the Music]]'', written by [[Bronte Woodward]] and [[Allan Carr]]'''
:''[[A Change Of Seasons (film)|A Change of Seasons]]'', written by [[Erich Segal]], [[Ronni Kern]] and [[Fred Segal]]
:''[[Cruising (film)|Cruising]]'', written by [[William Friedkin]]
:''[[The Formula]]'', written by [[Steve Shagan]]
:''[[It's My Turn]]'', written by [[Eleanor Bergstein]]
:''[[Middle Age Crazy]]'', written by [[Carl Kleinschmidt]]
:''[[Raise the Titanic!]]'', written by [[Adam Kennedy]] and [[Eric Hughes]]
:''[[Touched by Love]]'', written by [[Hesper Anderson]]
:''[[Windows (film)|Windows]]'', written by [[Barry Siegel]]
:''[[Xanadu (film)|Xanadu]]'', written by [[Richard C. Danus]] and [[Marc C. Rubel]]

==Worst &quot;Original&quot; Song==

'''&quot;The Man with Bogart's Face&quot; from ''[[The Man with Bogart's Face]]'', music by [[George Duning]], lyrics by [[Andrew Fenady]]'''
:&quot;(You) Can't Stop the Music&quot; from ''[[Can't Stop the Music]]'', music and lyrics by [[Jacques Morali]]
:&quot;Suspended in Time&quot; from ''[[Xanadu (film)|Xanadu]]'', music and lyrics by [[John Farrar]]
:&quot;Where Do You Catch the Bus for Tomorrow?&quot; from ''[[A Change of Seasons (film)|A Change of Seasons]]'', music by [[Henry Mancini]], lyrics by [[Marilyn Bergman]] and [[Alan Bergman]]
:&quot;You, Baby, Baby!&quot; from ''[[The Jazz Singer (1980 film)|The Jazz Singer]]'', music and lyrics by [[Neil Diamond]]

==Worst Career Achievement Award==

'''[[Ronald Reagan]]''', retired movie star

