      <text xml:space="preserve">'''''The Good, the Bad and the Live''''' is a [[Box Set|box set]] of [[single (music)|singles]] from [[1984]] to [[1989]] by [[Metallica]].

The new tracks were recorded in [[Seattle, Washington]], USA on [[August 29]]th and [[August 30|30]]th, [[1989]]. The set also included a poster.

