      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Politics of Belgium}}
{{Greens}}
'''Ecolo''' (officially standing for &quot;''Ecologistes Confédérés pour l'organisation de luttes originales''&quot;, but in reality shorthand for &quot;[[ecology movement|ecology]]&quot; or &quot;ecologist&quot;) is a [[French language|French]]-speaking [[Belgium|Belgian]] [[green party|green]] [[political party]] ([[Wallonia]] and [[Brussels-Capital Region|Brussels]]). It was part of the outgoing coalition, but resigned before the election and was decimated by a resurgent [[Socialist_Party_(francophone_Belgium)|Parti Socialiste]].

