*[http://www.mtholyoke.edu/acad/intrel/pentagon/pent1.html Pentagon Papers]
*[http://www.gwu.edu/~nsarchiv/NSAEBB/NSAEBB48/supreme.html Nixon Tapes &amp; Supreme Court Oral Arguments]
&lt;!-- Link is broken
*[http://www.vva.org/pentagon/links/links2.html Pentagon Papers Articles &amp; Documents]
--&gt;
