# {{note|www.beacon.org.56}} {{cite web | title=The Pentagon Papers, Senator Mike Gravel, Beacon Press | url=http://www.beacon.org/catalogs/pentagonpapers.html | accessdate=December 5 | accessyear=2005 }}
