      <contributor>
        <username>DaveGorman</username>
        <id>105150</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>/* Worst &quot;Original&quot; Song */  dab link</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">The 2nd [[Golden Raspberry Awards]] were held on [[March 29]], [[1982]]. They were presented at an Oscar night potluck party and recognized the worst the film industry had to offer of [[1981 in film|1981]]. The recipients are denoted in '''bold''':

==Worst Picture==

'''''[[Mommie Dearest (film)|Mommie Dearest]]'' ([[Paramount Pictures|Paramount]]), produced by [[Frank Yablans]]'''
:''[[Endless Love]]'' ([[Universal Studios|Universal]]/[[PolyGram]]), produced by [[Dyson Lovell]]
:''[[Heaven's Gate (movie)|Heaven's Gate]]'' ([[United Artists]]), produced by [[Joann Carelli]]
:''[[The Legend of the Lone Ranger]]'' ([[Universal Studios|Universal]]/[[Associated Film Distribution|AFD]]), produced by [[Walter Coblenz]]
:''[[Tarzan, the Ape Man]]'' ([[Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer|MGM]]/[[United Artists]]), produced by [[Bo Derek]]

==Worst Actor==

'''[[Klinton Spilsbury]] in ''[[The Legend of the Lone Ranger]]'''''
:[[Gary Coleman]] in ''[[On the Right Track]]''
:[[Bruce Dern]] in ''[[Tattoo (film)|Tattoo]]''
:[[Richard Harris (actor)|Richard Harris]] in ''[[Tarzan, the Ape Man]]''
:[[Kris Kristofferson]] in ''[[Heaven's Gate (film)|Heaven's Gate]]'' and ''[[Rollover (film)|Rollover]]''

==Worst Actress==

'''[[Bo Derek]] in ''[[Tarzan, the Ape Man]]''''' (tie)&lt;br&gt;
'''[[Faye Dunaway]] in ''[[Mommie Dearest (film)|Mommie Dearest]]''''' (tie)
:[[Linda Blair]] in ''[[Hell Night]]''
:[[Brooke Shields]] in ''[[Endless Love]]''
:[[Barbra Streisand]] in ''[[All Night Long (1981 film)|All Night Long]]''

==Worst Supporting Actor==

'''[[Steve Forrest]] in ''[[Mommie Dearest (film)|Mommie Dearest]]'''''
:[[Billy Barty]] in ''[[Under the Rainbow]]''
:[[Ernest Borgnine]] in ''[[Deadly Blessing]]''
:[[James Coco]] in ''[[Only When I Laugh (film)|Only When I Laugh]]''
:[[Danny DeVito]] in ''[[Goin' Ape!]]''

==Worst Supporting Actress==

'''[[Diana Scarwid]] in ''[[Mommie Dearest (film)|Mommie Dearest]]'''''
:[[Rutanya Alda]] in ''[[Mommie Dearest (film)|Mommie Dearest]]''
:[[Farrah Fawcett]] in ''[[Cannonball Run]]''
:[[Mara Hobel]] in ''[[Mommie Dearest (film)|Mommie Dearest]]''
:[[Shirley Knight]] in ''[[Endless Love]]''

==Worst Director==

'''[[Michael Cimino]] for ''[[Heaven's Gate (film)|Heaven's Gate]]'''''
:[[John Derek]] for ''[[Tarzan, the Ape Man]]''
:[[Blake Edwards]] for ''[[S.O.B.]]''
:[[Frank Perry]] for ''[[Mommie Dearest (film)|Mommie Dearest]]''
