      <comment>gdrbot - replaced {{disambig}} with {{shipindex}} (see discussion at [[Wikipedia talk:WikiProject Ships]])</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">Three ships of the [[United States Navy]] have been named '''USS ''Austin'''''.

*The first [[USS Austin (1839)|USS ''Austin'']], originally a [[sloop-of-war]] of the Texas Navy, was named in honor of [[Stephen Fuller Austin]].                    
*The second [[USS Austin (DE-15)|USS ''Austin'' (DE-15)]], a [[destroyer escort]], honored Chief Carpenter [[John Arnold Austin]].                                         
*The third [[USS Austin (LPD-4)|USS ''Austin'' (LPD-4)]], an [[amphibious transport dock]], was named for [[Austin, Texas|the capital]] of [[Texas]].

{{shipindex}}

[[Category:United States Navy ship names|Austin]]

