      <text xml:space="preserve">An '''antispasmodic''' is a [[medication|drug]] that suppresses smooth [[muscle]] contraction, especially in tubular organs. The effect is to prevent spasms of the stomach, intestine or bladder.  Typically these drugs are [[anticholinergic]]s.

{{pharma-stub}}
[[Category:Anticholinergics]]
[[Category:Gastrointestinal system drugs]]

[[fr:Antispasmodique]]
