      <text xml:space="preserve">The '''Boston Stock Exchange''' is a regional [[stock exchange]] located in [[Boston, Massachusetts|Boston]], [[Massachusetts]]. The third-oldest stock exchange in the [[United States]], it was founded in 1834.

