        <username>Kleinzach</username>
        <id>547500</id>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''''Veinticinco de agosto, 1983''''' (''August the 25th, 1983'') is a chamber [[opera]] by [[Juan Maria Solare]], to a [[Spanish language|Spanish]] [[libretto]] by [[Javier Adúriz]] based on the story by [[Jorge Luis Borges]]. Solare composed the opera from [[1992]] to [[1993]].  

The opera is approximately 37.5 minutes in length and consists of one act with fifteen scenes.

&lt;!-- When and where was it premiered? --&gt;
==Characters==
*Old Borges ([[Basso|bass]])
*Young Borges ([[tenor]])
*Speaker ([[baritone]] or tenor)
*Owner of the Hotel (baritone or bass)
*Chorus

==Orchestra== 
*Flute
*Tenor Saxophone
*String Quartet
*Piano
*Percussion (Suspended cymbal, 2 anvils, glockenspiel, vibraphone, 5 temple blocks, 3 tomtoms, tenor drum)


{{opera-stub}}

[[Category:Operas by Juan Maria Solare]]
