|colspan=&quot;2&quot;| Harvey Kneeslapper was a blonde-haired and wild-eyed [[Muppet]] in a blue sweater who always loved jokes and puns. He slapped letters and numbers on any of the [[Anything Muppet]]'s chests. Harvey disappeared from Sesame Street, because of mixed public response to the character, and his laughing was too hard on Muppeteer Frank Oz's throat.

