|[[Stephanie D'Abruzzo]]
|-
|colspan=&quot;2&quot;|(season 33 and 34) Lulu was a [[Muppet]] character. Lulu debuted in various skits on ''Sesame Street'', before appearing in Street-scenes. Her first Street-scene was part of a monster daycare group that stopped at [[Hooper's Store]]. She introduced herself to Alan, shaking his hand vigorously, and pointing out her name tag.

At least part of the reason that the character was short lived was Stephanie D'Abruzzo's commitments to the Broadway musical ''[[Avenue Q]]''.

