|[[Jerry Nelson]] (1970-on)
|-
|colspan=&quot;2&quot;| The resident [[magic (illusion)|magician]] on Sesame Street, Mumford's tricks do not always have the intended effect.  Among his magical miscues have been turning [[Grover]] into a [[rabbit]] while trying to pull a rabbit out of his hat, and dramatically increasing the size of [[Ernie|Ernie's]] [[rubber duck|Rubber Duckie]]. He is known by his magic phrase, &quot;A-la-peanut-butter-sandwiches!&quot;  His magic tricks would have worked if he had instead used the correct magic phrase, &quot;[http://www.sesameworkshop.org/aboutus/newsletter_article.php?contentId=70260&amp;type=sesame A-la-peanut-butter-and-jelly-sandwiches!]&quot; 
