      <comment>/* Sesame Street Characters, By order of debut */</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">==Sesame Street Characters, By order of debut==

The following is a list of characters on [[Sesame Street]], ordered by first appearance.

===1969 (Season 1)===
* [[Bert and Ernie]]
* [[Big Bird]]- debuted in season premiere
* [[Fat Blue]]
* [[Fuzzy-Face]], Grover's predecessor
* [[Lefty the Salesman]]
* [[Little Bird]]
* [[Lulu]] (Not to be confused with the Lulu from [[Hooper's Store]] and The Monster Daycare, this Lulu is Mr. Otis's Girlfriend, From Season 1). 
* [[Mr. Otis]]
* [[Oscar the Grouch]], orange fur- debuted in season premiere.
* [[Sam Hastings from Grove]]

==1970s==
===1970 (Season 2) ===
* [[Grover]]
* [[Guy Smiley]]
* [[Harvey Kneeslapper]]
* [[List_of_Sesame_Street_characters#Secondary_Puppet_Characters|Herbert Birdsfoot]]
* [[List_of_Sesame_Street_characters#Secondary_Puppet_Characters|Herry Monster]]
* [[Oscar the Grouch]], green fur- debuted in season premiere
* [[Professor Hastings]]
* [[Roosevelt Franklin]]
* [[Sherlock Hemlock]]

===1971===
* [[Aloysius Snuffleupagus]]- debuted in season premiere
* [[Frazzle]]
* [[Gladys the Cow]]
* [[Granny Fanny Nesselrode]]
* [[Simon the Soundman]]
* [[Twiddlebugs]]

===1972===
* [[Count von Count]]
* [[Sam the Robot]]- debuted in season premiere
* [[Yip-Yips]]

===1973===
* [[Biff and Sully]]
* [[Don Music]]

===1974===
* [[Rodeo Rosie]]



===1978===
* [[Two-Headed Monster|The Two-Headed Monster]]

===1979===
* [[Elmo]] (introduced as minor character)
* [[Telly Monster]]
* [[Honkers]]

==1980s==
===1982===
* [[List of Sesame Street characters|Dingers]]

===1983===
* [[Deena Monster]]
* [[Grungetta Grunge]]
* [[Pearl Monster]]

===1985===
* [[Hoots the Owl]]

===1986===
* [[Placido Flamingo]]

==1990s==
===1991===
* [[Baby Bear]]
* [[Rosita (Sesame Street)|Rosita]]

===1993===
* [[Monty]]
* [[Zoe (Sesame Street)|Zoe]]

==2000s==
===2000 (Season 31)===
* [[Lulu (Sesame Street)|Lulu]]

===2002 (Season 33)===
* [[Googel]] (Monster's Clubhouse)
* [[Mel (Sesame Street)|Mel]] (Monster's Clubhouse)
* [[Narf]] (Monster's Clubhouse)
* [[Phoebe (Sesame Street)|Phoebe]] (Monster's Clubhouse)

===2003 (Season 34) ===
* [[Curly Bear]]

* [[Barbara the Chicken]]
* [[Leonard the Wolf]]

