*** [http://stopgavage.com/ Stopgavage] Manifesto for the abolition of force-feeding (French site with pages in English)
*** [http://www.stopforcefeeding.com/ Stop Force-Feeding]
*** [http://www.petatv.com/tvpopup/Prefs.asp?video=delicacy_despair &quot;Delicacy of Despair&quot;], PETA video on foie gras production
